Subject: Support macOS 27 and 27.2 on the official yabai source

Base: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/commit/dd845723416f5fe92af49fad5ebab00369e07edd
Client version gates: https://github.com/AhsanFazal/yabai/commit/ad0a12d63f639534a296a1d065b0d04979f1b4db
Dock patterns and API: https://github.com/LCS-Dev-Ergos/Yabai/commit/9da3923176d88e6c44a7802fa7d6374ae40414f4
Space guards: https://github.com/LCS-Dev-Ergos/Yabai/commit/8135286ece81646f12e6afaf59667e29ae1e1ae9
Loader requirements: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/issues/2832#issuecomment-6401082209
Upstream tracking: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/issues/2832
Pattern search tool: https://gist.github.com/AhsanFazal/d18a54b9dc0f259b49e21b8ed70078d2/a853e09ed9d98d1785a5d9ec5f46169258c2590d

Targets: macOS 27.0 and 27.2, Apple Silicon.
Local OS: macOS 27.2 (26B123); local runtime unverified.
Source runtime report: macOS 27.0.1 (26A434), M3, in the loader comment above.
Source runtime report: macOS 27.2 beta (26B5091g), M1 Pro.
The arm64e.x1 slice has only been examined statically by the source author.
Space focus, creation and destruction are supported by the source patch;
moving Spaces remains unsupported because DPPM and move_space are unresolved.

Keep the upstream macOS 26.6 changes and the existing client version gates.
Use OSAX_VERSION 2.1.32 to replace the earlier forks' 2.1.31 payload.
Relax loader capability requirements only on macOS 27.
Use the existing Space selector when available and the 27.2 selector otherwise.

For new OS builds, record the build, Dock SHA-256 and architecture slice.
Analyze /System/Library/CoreServices/Dock.app/Contents/MacOS/Dock per slice;
the pattern search tool does not parse universal Mach-O files.
Trace clearBindingForBundleID:, CGSMoveManagedSpaceToDisplayIndex and
SLSTransactionDestroySpace in Ghidra before changing signatures.
A byte-pattern match alone does not establish the target's identity.

